   "text": "ALICE M. (MRS. PAUL LAWRENCE) DUNBAR, Wilmington, Del.\n\n\"I have never read a publication that has appealed to me so strongly as yours. It is 'brimful' of interesting matter, and I trust that your efforts will be crowned with great success.\"\n\nW. SHOCKLY.",
